Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatible with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: luma-plugin-3dsrpc

Summary: Discord Rich Presence for the 3DS

Description: |
  A privacy-focused alternative for Discord Rich Presence on the 3DS.
  Reports the game you're playing to a companion app on your PC,
  which shows it on your Discord profile.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false